The spherical harmonics therefore satisfy $\begin{aligned}
L^2Y_{\ell m}
&=\hbar^2\ell(\ell+1)Y_{\ell m}, \\
L_zY_{\ell m}
&=\hbar m\,Y_{\ell m}.\end{aligned}$ For each orbital value $\ell=0,1,2,\ldots$, there are $2\ell+1$ functions labeled by $m=-\ell,\ldots,\ell$.

