Introduce the dimensionless operators $A_+=\frac{p+i\omega x}{\sqrt{2\hbar\omega}},
\qquad
A_-=\frac{p-i\omega x}{\sqrt{2\hbar\omega}}.$ They are Hermitian conjugates: $A_+^\dagger=A_-.$ Their commutator is $\begin{aligned}
&=\frac{1}{2\hbar\omega}
\left([p,i\omega x]+[-i\omega x,p]\right) \\
&=1.\end{aligned}$

